WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
The AXOM Dashboard. A precise click starts a 25-minute focus timer.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.500
The camera enters the timer ring and emerges at Course Tracker.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.700
A lecture records its first pass. The count changes from zero of two to one of two.

00:10.700 --> 00:16.300
A practice answer is selected. Only after Check answer does the reviewed result appear.

00:16.300 --> 00:21.000
An activity is logged. Recorded study time increases from 35 to 60 minutes, meeting the selected daily target.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
In Journal: Reviewed the lecture. Practiced the questions I missed.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Focus ends with three, two, one. The timer switches to Break.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
The original AXOM mark and wordmark appear: A private academic operating system. Return to the opening dashboard.
